1 septembre, de 7h30 à 10h00<\/li><\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p>Nous serons ravis de vous accueillir et de discuter avec vous.<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p>À bientôt sur votre ligne T12 !<\/p>","disruption_id":"51e0fa6e-b9f4-4263-94f4-a60899f3d2a5"},{"id":"562b1d5f-54ea-4fea-8590-ee30064c8b2e","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260903T172705","end":"20260904T043000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260903T173012","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","tags":["Actualité"],"title":"Métro 6 : Incident d'exploitation - Trafic perturbé","message":"<p>Le trafic est perturbé sur toute la ligne en raison d'un incident d'exploitation  .<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","disruption_id":"537e89f7-6581-488d-b472-9fedbd56e5bf"},{"id":"6dff2683-5e99-4eb6-8850-85fabaff6681","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260903T164227","end":"20260903T164327"}],"lastUpdate":"20260903T164619","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","tags":["Actualité"],"title":"Métro 9 : Ajustement de l'intervalle entre les trains - Train stationne","message":"<p>Un train stationne entre Oberkampf et Mairie de Montreuil en raison d'un ajustement de l'intervalle entre les trains  .<\/p>","shortMessage":"Train stationne","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01379","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71803","name":"Oberkampf (Paris)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71785","name":"Mairie de Montreuil (Montreuil)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01379","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71785","name":"Mairie de Montreuil (Montreuil)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71803","name":"Oberkampf (Paris)"}}],"disruption_id":"f58031a8-96ab-4981-a68d-b10762b58b40"},{"id":"c296d0d1-8bd9-4c25-9de0-475459fa9556","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260903T163501","end":"20260904T043000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260903T163820","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"BLOQUANTE","tags":["Actualité"],"title":"Tramway T1 : Panne électrique - Trafic interrompu","message":"<p>Le trafic est interrompu entre Gar